{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-route-service",
      "fault_kind": "database_call_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT 'normal' src, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,3) avg_ms FROM normal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT%' UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', count(*), round(avg(duration)/1e6,3) FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name LIKE 'SELECT%'",
          "claim": "ts-route-service SELECT DB spans average about 0.12 ms normally but about 130 ms in the incident window."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms, round(quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6,1) p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1 ORDER BY 1",
          "claim": "Every ts-route-service DB client span (SELECT ts.route, route_distances, route_stations) is slow, p95 400–630 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND attr_span_kind='Internal' AND span_name IN ('Transaction.commit','RouteRepository.findAll','RouteRepository.findById') GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Route repository and transaction commit methods are slow in-process, matching the slow DB calls underneath them."
        },
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT 'normal' src, round(avg(value),4) cpu FROM normal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND metric='container.cpu.usage' UNION ALL SELECT 'abnormal', round(avg(value),4) FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE service_name='ts-route-service' AND metric='container.cpu.usage'",
          "claim": "ts-route-service container CPU does not rise during the incident, so the slowness is not CPU saturation."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-route-service",
      "to": "ts-basic-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-basic-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-basic-service's calls to ts-route-service routes/byIds take about 240 ms, matching route-service server time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-basic-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-travel-service' AND c.service_name='ts-basic-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-travel-service's calls to ts-basic-service travels take about 340 ms, inheriting basic's latency."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-basic-service",
      "to": "ts-travel2-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-travel2-service' AND c.service_name='ts-basic-service' GROUP BY 1,2",
          "claim": "ts-travel2-service's calls to ts-basic-service travels take about 68 ms, showing the same inherited delay."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-service",
      "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-route-plan-service's calls to ts-travel-service trips/left take about 306 ms, carrying the slowdown upward."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel2-service",
      "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-travel2-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-route-plan-service's calls to ts-travel2-service trips/left take about 90 ms, showing the same inherited delay."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-route-service",
      "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-route-plan-service calls to ts-route-service routes/{start}/{end} take about 1855 ms, matching route-service server time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND c.service_name='ts-route-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-travel-plan-service calls to ts-route-plan-service take 540–2990 ms, matching route-plan server time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard calls to ts-travel-plan-service take about 500–3400 ms, passing the delay to users."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-route-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT p.service_name caller, c.service_name callee, c.span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(p.duration)/1e6,1) caller_client_ms, round(avg(c.duration)/1e6,1) callee_server_ms FROM abnormal_traces p JOIN abnormal_traces c ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.attr_span_kind='Client' AND c.attr_span_kind='Server' AND p.service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND c.service_name='ts-route-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "ts-ui-dashboard's GET routes calls to ts-route-service take about 8.5 s on average, directly exposing users to the delay."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

**Summary:** The user-visible degradation comes from one fault: `ts-route-service` has slow database calls. Its `SELECT` DB spans went from about 0.12 ms to about 130 ms, with no CPU or memory pressure, no restarts and no network signal. The slowness reaches users through `ts-basic-service`, `ts-travel-service` and `ts-travel2-service`, then `ts-route-plan-service`, then `ts-travel-plan-service`, and directly through `ts-ui-dashboard`'s `GET /api/v1/routeservice/routes` (about 8.5 s average). The `ts-verification-code-service` WARN logs are at the same rate as in normal traffic, so they are baseline noise and were not counted as a fault.
